# Without the currency predicate, the list ignores the filter and answers the wrong rows.

title: the currency filter is bound and then ignored
file: internal/ledger/balance.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestTheListNarrowsToACurrency -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
		  WHERE (nullif($1::text, '') IS NULL OR currency = $1::text)
--- after
		  WHERE (nullif($1::text, '') IS NULL OR true)
